# Accepted vulnerability findings for the Heinzel image (CVE id plus exp:YYYY-MM-DD and a reason).

# @azure/msal-node 5.6.0 (via @microsoft/teams.apps, which requires ^5.6.0; the fix is only in 7.x), reviewed 2026-10-24.
# The issue is in the authorization code flow. The Teams SDK only uses the client credential and federated identity
# flows, so Heinzel is not affected. Drop this once the Teams SDK moves to msal-node 7.
CVE-2026-109461 exp:2026-11-30
